{"vid":"npHMcZqFr2Y","source":"npHMcZqFr2Y.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.2,"txt":"You know, all around us there's this"},{"t":2,"txt":"massive, almost invisible infrastructure"},{"t":4.1,"txt":"that powers our world. We're talking"},{"t":6,"txt":"about these silent giants standing guard"},{"t":8.2,"txt":"over the energy we use every single day."},{"t":10.5,"txt":"These are energy storage tanks. And"},{"t":12.5,"txt":"building them, well, that's a world of"},{"t":14.2,"txt":"incredible precision, super high stakes,"},{"t":16.6,"txt":"and some seriously deep expertise."},{"t":19,"txt":"Today, we're going to go inside that"},{"t":20.9,"txt":"world. All right, so to really get the"},{"t":23.1,"txt":"inside scoop, we need a guide who knows"},{"t":25.2,"txt":"the terrain. So, meet Herve Yima Manguo."},{"t":29.1,"txt":"He was just named one of Stock Expo's 40"},{"t":31.5,"txt":"under 40 leaders in the tank storage"},{"t":33.5,"txt":"industry. That means he's not just some"},{"t":35.6,"txt":"expert. He's literally one of the people"},{"t":37.4,"txt":"shaping the future of this whole field."},{"t":39.5,"txt":"So, let's see what it takes to get to"},{"t":41.1,"txt":"that level. So, how do you become one of"},{"t":43.4,"txt":"the top experts building these giants? I"},{"t":46.1,"txt":"mean, a title like 40 under 40 doesn't"},{"t":47.8,"txt":"just fall out of the sky. It's earned."},{"t":49.8,"txt":"And it's earned through a deep and"},{"t":51.8,"txt":"you'll see an incredibly specific set of"},{"t":54.4,"txt":"skills. It starts right here on his very"},{"t":57.3,"txt":"first above ground storage tank"},{"t":59,"txt":"certification course. Hervey scored a"},{"t":61.4,"txt":"perfect 100%. Not a 98, not a 99, a"},{"t":65.8,"txt":"perfect score. That tells you pretty"},{"t":68,"txt":"much everything you need to know about"},{"t":69.4,"txt":"the level of precision we're dealing"},{"t":71,"txt":"with here. And believe me, that was just"},{"t":73.4,"txt":"the beginning. His expertise covers"},{"t":76.1,"txt":"everything from microbiologically"},{"t":78.3,"txt":"influenced corrosion. I mean, that's"},{"t":80.6,"txt":"literally preventing micros from eating"},{"t":82.6,"txt":"away at solid steel to managing these"},{"t":85.4,"txt":"complex protective coatings. Every"},{"t":87.8,"txt":"single one of these is a specialty that"},{"t":89.8,"txt":"helps prevent catastrophic failure. And"},{"t":91.9,"txt":"if you really want to understand the"},{"t":93.1,"txt":"stakes, just read this. This is straight"},{"t":95.8,"txt":"from the security procedures for his API"},{"t":97.8,"txt":"certification exam. They inspect your"},{"t":100,"txt":"eyeglasses for hidden cameras. No"},{"t":102,"txt":"jewelry allowed. Just think about that"},{"t":104.3,"txt":"for a second. This isn't just a test."},{"t":106.3,"txt":"It's a high security event. Why? because"},{"t":108.8,"txt":"the knowledge being certified is what"},{"t":110.3,"txt":"protects billions of dollars in"},{"t":111.6,"txt":"infrastructure and more importantly"},{"t":113.8,"txt":"keeps communities safe. Okay, so now"},{"t":116.3,"txt":"that we've met the expert, let's zoom"},{"t":118.2,"txt":"out and look at the stage where this"},{"t":119.6,"txt":"kind of expertise is so desperately"},{"t":121.4,"txt":"needed, the African energy landscape. To"},{"t":124.6,"txt":"really get a sense of the scale, you"},{"t":126.2,"txt":"just need to know one number. According"},{"t":128.1,"txt":"to KPMG, a staggering 57% of Africa's"},{"t":132.1,"txt":"entire export earnings come from"},{"t":133.8,"txt":"hydrocarbons. This isn't just one"},{"t":136.1,"txt":"industry among many. For a huge part of"},{"t":138.4,"txt":"the continent, it is the economy. Now,"},{"t":141,"txt":"this chart shows one of the continent's"},{"t":142.9,"txt":"biggest economic puzzles. Africa is an"},{"t":145.4,"txt":"absolute powerhouse when it comes to"},{"t":146.9,"txt":"producing crude oil, but its refining"},{"t":148.8,"txt":"capacity just can't keep up. This"},{"t":150.6,"txt":"creates this huge infrastructure gap."},{"t":152.8,"txt":"They end up exporting raw crude only to"},{"t":155.1,"txt":"have to import it back as more expensive"},{"t":157,"txt":"refined fuel. And what's the key to"},{"t":158.5,"txt":"closing that gap? You guessed it,"},{"t":160.4,"txt":"storage. And when we look at the hard"},{"t":162.2,"txt":"numbers, you can see where these"},{"t":163.6,"txt":"resources are concentrated. Libya,"},{"t":165.6,"txt":"Nigeria, Angola, Algeria, and Egypt."},{"t":168.4,"txt":"They hold the vast majority of the"},{"t":169.8,"txt":"continent's proven reserves. We're"},{"t":171.4,"txt":"talking tens of billions of barrels."},{"t":173.6,"txt":"It's an incredible resource that demands"},{"t":175.2,"txt":"an equally incredible infrastructure to"},{"t":176.9,"txt":"manage it all. So, with this massive"},{"t":179.1,"txt":"need for infrastructure, how do you"},{"t":181,"txt":"actually go about building one of these"},{"t":182.5,"txt":"giants? It's not as simple as putting"},{"t":184.6,"txt":"together a kit from IKEA, that's for"},{"t":186.5,"txt":"sure. It requires a precise,"},{"t":188.3,"txt":"industry-proven blueprint to turn a plan"},{"t":190.5,"txt":"into a safe functioning reality. And"},{"t":192.8,"txt":"that blueprint, it has a name, EPCS. You"},{"t":195.9,"txt":"can think of it as the master recipe for"},{"t":197.8,"txt":"the entire industry. It stands for"},{"t":199.7,"txt":"engineering, procurement, construction,"},{"t":202.2,"txt":"commissioning, and startup. It's the"},{"t":204.1,"txt":"proven step-by-step process that turns"},{"t":206.1,"txt":"an empty plot of land into a fully"},{"t":208.1,"txt":"operational billiondoll facility. Let's"},{"t":211,"txt":"just quickly walk through it. It all"},{"t":212.9,"txt":"starts with engineering. That's taking"},{"t":214.4,"txt":"the idea from a sketch to a"},{"t":215.9,"txt":"superdetailed blueprint. Then comes"},{"t":218,"txt":"procurement, sourcing every single part"},{"t":220.4,"txt":"from giant steel plates to tiny"},{"t":222.3,"txt":"specialized valves. Next up is"},{"t":224.4,"txt":"construction, the actual physical build"},{"t":226.7,"txt":"on site. And finally, commissioning and"},{"t":229,"txt":"startup. That's where the finished tank"},{"t":230.6,"txt":"is tested like crazy before it's"},{"t":232.4,"txt":"officially brought to life. And the"},{"t":234.2,"txt":"reason this EPCS framework is so"},{"t":236.3,"txt":"critical is that it's the process that"},{"t":238.4,"txt":"guarantees these massive assets are"},{"t":240.7,"txt":"built correctly. It's what ensures"},{"t":242.5,"txt":"they're safe for the people working"},{"t":243.8,"txt":"there, that they're compliant with all"},{"t":245.4,"txt":"the strict regulations, and that they're"},{"t":247.1,"txt":"going to run efficiently for decades."},{"t":249,"txt":"Without this structure, the risk of"},{"t":250.7,"txt":"failure is just way too high. But here's"},{"t":252.8,"txt":"the catch. A framework like EPCS is only"},{"t":256.1,"txt":"as good as the people who are executing"},{"t":258.3,"txt":"it. And that brings us to a huge"},{"t":260.7,"txt":"industry-wide challenge. The"},{"t":262.8,"txt":"infrastructure gap is one problem, but"},{"t":265,"txt":"there's a growing gap in the most"},{"t":266.3,"txt":"critical resource of all, the experts"},{"t":268.8,"txt":"needed to do the work. So, how big is"},{"t":271.4,"txt":"this problem? Well, get this. A recent"},{"t":274.2,"txt":"manufacturing survey found that 67%"},{"t":277,"txt":"that's twothirds of professionals are"},{"t":279.1,"txt":"seeing this skills gap with their own"},{"t":280.9,"txt":"eyes. It's kind of a silent crisis"},{"t":283,"txt":"that's slowing down major projects all"},{"t":285.4,"txt":"over the world. But here's the really"},{"t":287.4,"txt":"surprising part. You'd think the biggest"},{"t":289.6,"txt":"gaps would be in some super technical"},{"t":292,"txt":"area, right? Well, nope. The number one"},{"t":294.8,"txt":"missing skill is communication. That's"},{"t":297.3,"txt":"followed by quality control, technical"},{"t":299.4,"txt":"troubleshooting, and leadership. These"},{"t":301.5,"txt":"are the human skills you need to make"},{"t":303.3,"txt":"incredibly complex projects like"},{"t":305.3,"txt":"building a giant storage tank actually"},{"t":307.6,"txt":"happen successfully. So, what's the"},{"t":309.5,"txt":"solution? Well, it really boils down to"},{"t":312.2,"txt":"upskilling. And the results are like"},{"t":314.4,"txt":"night and day. When companies actually"},{"t":316.4,"txt":"invest in training their people, 97% of"},{"t":319.4,"txt":"employees feel more confident and 95%"},{"t":322.2,"txt":"report higher job satisfaction. It's"},{"t":324.6,"txt":"proof that investing in people creates a"},{"t":326.9,"txt":"more capable and a more committed"},{"t":329,"txt":"workforce. And ultimately, it all comes"},{"t":331.1,"txt":"back to the core principles of the job,"},{"t":333.1,"txt":"which Hervey sums up perfectly right"},{"t":334.9,"txt":"here. This work demands constant,"},{"t":337.3,"txt":"unwavering attention to three things:"},{"t":339.8,"txt":"quality, safety, and the environment."},{"t":342.6,"txt":"Those are the pillars, and they can only"},{"t":344.6,"txt":"be held up by skilled experts. And that"},{"t":347.4,"txt":"leaves us with one final question to"},{"t":349.4,"txt":"chew on. As technology like AI continues"},{"t":352.6,"txt":"to change these industries, what's our"},{"t":354.9,"txt":"real challenge moving forward? Is it"},{"t":357,"txt":"just about building better, smarter"},{"t":358.8,"txt":"machines?"}],"words":[{"t":0.16,"w":"You"},{"t":0.4,"w":"know,"},{"t":0.64,"w":"all"},{"t":0.8,"w":"around"},{"t":1.12,"w":"us"},{"t":1.439,"w":"there's"},{"t":1.76,"w":"this"},{"t":2,"w":"massive,"},{"t":2.56,"w":"almost"},{"t":2.879,"w":"invisible"},{"t":3.52,"w":"infrastructure"},{"t":4.08,"w":"that"},{"t":4.319,"w":"powers"},{"t":4.64,"w":"our"},{"